@startuml
actor Tutor
participant API
participant GetTotalTeachingTimeHandler as Handler
database SQLServer as DB

Tutor -> API: GET /api/tutors/me/lessons/total-teaching-time
API -> Handler: Query(authenticated tutor account ID)
Handler -> DB: Select start and end of owned completed lessons
DB --> Handler: Lesson time slots
Handler -> Handler: Sum durations in seconds
Handler --> API: TotalTeachingTimeResponse
API --> Tutor: 200 OK (totalTeachingSeconds)
@enduml
